function normalizeSearchPlayer(raw){return {name:String(raw?.DisplayName??raw?.displayName??raw?.Username??raw?.username??raw?.name??'Unknown survivor'),platform:String(raw?.OsBrand??raw?.platform??raw?.Platform??raw?.device??'Console'),id:raw?.UserId??raw?.userId??raw?.Id??raw?.id??null,ping:Number.isFinite(Number(raw?.Ping??raw?.ping))?Number(raw.Ping??raw.ping):null,seconds:Number.isFinite(Number(raw?.ConnectedSeconds??raw?.connectedSeconds))?Number(raw.ConnectedSeconds??raw.connectedSeconds):null};}
async function searchPlayer(guildId,query){const p=serverProfiles.get(guildId);if(!p?.rconPassword)throw Error('RCON password is missing');const raw=await rconRequest(p,'playerlist');let parsed;try{parsed=typeof raw==='string'?JSON.parse(raw):raw;}catch{throw Error('RCON returned an unreadable player list');}const list=Array.isArray(parsed)?parsed:(parsed?.players||parsed?.Players||parsed?.data?.players);if(!Array.isArray(list))throw Error('RCON returned no readable players');const q=query.toLowerCase();return list.map(normalizeSearchPlayer).find(x=>x.name.toLowerCase().includes(q))||null;}
function searchCard(p,q){const platform=String(p.platform||'Console');const badge=platform.toLowerCase().includes('xbox')?'🟢 Xbox':platform.toLowerCase().includes('playstation')||platform.toLowerCase().includes('psn')?'🔵 PlayStation':'🎮 '+platform;const ping=p.ping===null?'⚪ Not returned':p.ping<80?'🟢 '+p.ping+' ms • Stable':p.ping<160?'🟡 '+p.ping+' ms • Fair':'🔴 '+p.ping+' ms • High';const session=p.seconds===null?'Not returned':p.seconds<3600?Math.max(1,Math.floor(p.seconds/60))+' min':Math.floor(p.seconds/3600)+'h '+Math.floor((p.seconds%3600)/60)+'m';return brand('PLAYER SIGNAL // PRIVATE').setColor(PURPLE).setDescription('**RUST CONSOLE NETWORK SEARCH**\n\n╭─ ACTIVE SURVIVOR LOCATED ─╮\n　Read-only live lookup from RCON.').addFields({name:'QUERY',value:q.slice(0,80),inline:true},{name:'PRESENCE',value:'Online & active',inline:true},{name:'GAMERTAG',value:p.name.slice(0,100),inline:true},{name:'CONSOLE NETWORK',value:badge,inline:true},{name:'NETWORK LATENCY',value:ping,inline:true},{name:'⏳ ACTIVE SESSION',value:session,inline:true},{name:'PLATFORM ID',value:p.id?'Available • hidden':'Not returned',inline:true},{name:'PRIVACY BOUNDARY',value:'No server address, port, region, credentials, profile links, or moderation actions are exposed.'}).setFooter({text:'RustPulse Pop'});}
